 "scratch": "设计5个不超过50的整数，和能被5整除。选32, 28, 35, 30, 25。和=150。平均=30。检查：所有数<=50。知识点：平均数意义与求法。",
 "solver_code": "from fractions import Fraction\ndef solve():\n    data = [32, 28, 35, 30, 25]\n    total = sum(data)\n    avg = total / len(data)\n    return [avg]",
